{
  "id": "ss.char.hourglass",
  "name": "Hourglass",
  "description": "A survivor pinched at the waist — the wasp of the eight. Broad chest, broad hips, and a petiole between them a couple of pixels wide, which is the hourglass it used to be turned into a body: two chambers with a throat that nothing passes through. Two pale wings lie folded back off the shoulders, and the hips carry the wasp's dark bands. It swings the chained head — a Soldier's head-plate packed solid on a cord — from the near hand, and it hangs there swinging even when the body is still, because a thing that heavy never quite stops. Reach is what this one has: the longest arm on the roster, and the ball adds to it. Same dead organ as the rest, same place. Bare chitin cold slate, venom-green plate over it. Drawn facing +x; the game flips it.",
